{"id": "q_the_emergency_council_meeting_1", "question": "What are the wizards asking the council to do in the emergency meeting-and what's the catch?", "answer": "TL;DR: The wizards (via the Wizard’s College) are pushing the council toward aggressive, city-wide countermeasures against the cult—likely detection, lockdown, or purification—but the catch is these measures risk harming or isolating citizens and may play into the cult’s plan if rushed or misapplied.\n\nFrom CANON and OBSERVED facts, the Wizard’s College is actively working to detect and counter the cult (“Subject of detection and counteraction by Tinkerbright and the Wizard’s College”). In the emergency council context, proposals on the table include:\n- A **city-wide lockdown** (CANON: “city-wide lockdown is being pushed for”)\n- A **city-wide purification effort** (CANON: “requires purification of the entire city”)\n\nThe catch:\n- These actions could **isolate parts of the city** or disrupt infrastructure (“Parts of the city could be left isolated if key tunnels or access points are sealed”).\n- They may **harm or target innocent citizens**, who are already “the city’s people” and potentially mixed with cult influence.\n- The council is **divided and under time pressure**, meaning rushed decisions could “bring the city closer to disaster.”\n- There may be **cult sympathizers within the council**, so giving sweeping authority or acting on bad intel could backfire.\n\nKey Attributes:\n- Governance: Emergency council meeting with voting and competing proposals\n- Operational Status: ქალაქ under threat; lockdown and purification proposed\n- Conflict: Cult operating beneath the city; infiltration and summoning threat\n- Defenses: ქალაქ defenses can be activated; proposals to reinforce positions", "has_error": false, "retrieval": {"enabled": true, "top_k": 30, "pre_filter_count": 2069, "post_filter_count": 30, "duration_ms": 164, "top_5": [["ent_council", 2.46], ["ent_bird", 1.64], ["ent_the_summoning_process", 1.539], ["ent_consequences_catch_up", 1.3109], ["ent_wizards", 1.2605]], "selected_entity_ids": ["ent_council", "ent_bird", "ent_the_summoning_process", "ent_consequences_catch_up", "ent_wizards", "ent_disappearing_guards", "ent_wizards_meat_detection_spell", "ent_mirathorn_city_council", "ent_arcana", "ent_elara_swiftwind", "ent_mirathorn", "ent_the_city", "ent_the_cult", "ent_city_council_meeting", "ent_copper_medallion", "ent_corrupted_guards", "ent_durnek_flamebrow", "ent_enchanted_paper_bird", "ent_follow_up_meeting", "ent_iron_token", "ent_kaiju_mass", "ent_session_11_midnight_politics", "ent_side_yard", "ent_signboard", "ent_sparkling_dust", "ent_steel_feather", "ent_room", "ent_grobnok_fuckfight", "ent_cultists", "ent_torbin_jove"], "semantic_rerank": {"enabled": false}, "evidence_first": {"enabled": true, "duration_ms": 65, "top_k": 24, "neighbor_window": 1, "max_neighbors": 24, "selected_count": 63, "seeded_count": 35, "selected_evidence_ids": ["evid_d3048c31b4aeb491", "evid_e8840d11bac1f541", "evid_209b2689e7059a51", "evid_209b2689e7059a51", "evid_ae1fb4dff7580643", "evid_cb55f13c87afb07b", "evid_8231863d9eff27c2", "evid_92a5213e71dc4736", "evid_88ff01511fbdec5b", "evid_5de3fe54246fba49", "evid_c589dd49eb5ce11c", "evid_0d921072506244a0", "evid_130a830195521022", "evid_9a43121323d4846b", "evid_8f8a8f08f5ecbc2b", "evid_d714b7291a00fbd5", "evid_6adc912c85df5e0a", "evid_095acd58ffe842a8", "evid_3d7ad4320dbdc4c0", "evid_ded5ea7ba6e49945", "evid_2c6f2f2ec29f901f", "evid_095acd58ffe842a8", "evid_3d7ad4320dbdc4c0", "evid_1255108469c9904a", "evid_850ce8bedfa6f074", "evid_e444f71e96ea2dc5", "evid_28341a77bf57f963", "evid_401538c2641d534a", "evid_ab01be3f62d9323a", "evid_b6f378d3047b68d7", "evid_37aeb4e53a3e3863", "evid_401538c2641d534a", "evid_ab01be3f62d9323a", "evid_b6f378d3047b68d7", "evid_37aeb4e53a3e3863", "evid_36d0fa302e351012", "evid_fbde180096cc886e", "evid_8f2a86c0985b130c", "evid_a09f3bc4c7d6cd5b", "evid_99679acc2adc1659", "evid_823a5a70faa25204", "e